juebot development bundle
Package: @local/dsh-juebot
Version: 0.3.0-dev.3

Scope and status
----------------
This is an undeployed setup candidate. It persists small profile-namespaced
control settings through the Host storage domain. Administrator numbers are
personal-QQ preregistrations and remain pending-proof; official QQ OpenID and
Bilibili identity mapping are not implemented. Path check/confirmation uses
metadata only and never creates, opens or migrates a business database.
The separate storage backend remains disabled with storagePath:null.
No QQ/Bilibili, model, Code executor or background operations are activated.
Native Host, authenticated HTTP and visual verification are separate from local
tests. Installation or restart requires the official DSH manager and authorization.

Compatibility declaration
-------------------------
The manifest targets DSH 0.2.1-rc.3 exactly.
Node >=22.18.0 is a declared requirement, not a claim that every matching
Node version has been tested. Runtime and integration evidence must be
reported separately from this declaration.
Only exact shipped storage-domain and Zod peers are declared. No dependencies
or package lifecycle scripts are declared; do not auto-install missing peers.

Artwork provenance
------------------
icon.svg is original artwork created specifically for juebot in this
metadata round: a robot-shaped speech bubble and a memory-chip antenna,
constructed from basic SVG geometry. It incorporates no third-party artwork,
fonts, remote images, linked resources, or scripts.
XML parsing and static resource checks do not prove rendering in the DSH UI.
